                            <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-border-default bg-page px-3 py-1.5 text-small font-medium text-content transition-colors hover:border-brand-red hover:text-brand-red" href="https://claude.ai/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
